{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主个性及特色情况如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱丁卯、月柱癸丑、日柱甲子、时柱丁卯。日主甲木生于丑月，土旺木囚，但得子水正印生扶，且年时两柱卯木为根，身弱但有印比相助。甲木坐子水，水木相生，主聪明、有仁心，但月柱癸丑，癸水透干，丑为湿土，内藏辛金正官、癸水正印、己土正财，形成财官印相生，但丑土为财库，且癸水偏印透出，偏印主思想多、多虑、内向。时柱丁卯，丁火伤官透出，伤官主才华外露，但卯木为劫财，劫财主好胜、风流、朋友多。整体看，甲木日主有印生、有根，但偏印和伤官组合，性格上偏内向、多思，但伤官又带来情绪化和才华外露的矛盾。结合选项，C“内向，沉默寡言，情绪化”最符合偏印旺、伤官藏的组合特征。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3953, "response_id": "a4797d18-38cd-4489-8fcb-dd3798160501", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 257, "total_tokens": 493, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和出生如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子。日主壬水生于申月，金旺水相，得月令生扶，又时柱壬子水强根，身旺。年柱癸丑，劫财坐正官七杀，月柱庚申偏印生身，时柱壬子比肩帮身。整体水势强旺，金水相生，性格上聪明灵活，足智多谋（水主智），且月柱庚申为偏印，主思维敏捷、有谋略。同时，年柱癸丑中暗藏正官，月柱庚申为偏印生身，有仗义之气（金主义）。但身旺无制，水多则固执，不易听劝。关于出生家庭，年柱癸丑，丑为金库，且月柱庚申为偏印得禄，印星旺相，通常代表家庭有一定根基或祖业，但并非大富大贵，更偏向于殷实或有钱家庭（印星为庇护，年柱为祖上，丑为财库，但被癸水盖头，财不显，故非极富，但可称有钱）。综合来看，最符合“足智多谋，为人仗义，但比较固执，出生在有钱家庭”的描述。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4377, "response_id": "ca96616b-f5b2-4c1d-a210-09eb48928e17", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 262, "completion_tokens": 296, "total_tokens": 558, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 6}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主壬水，生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，金水相生，属于身强水旺之局。水旺之人通常喜流动、智慧、深邃，但过旺则需土来制水，火来调候。命局中土（丑、辰）为官杀，火（午未）不显，但月令申金生水，金水过旺，性格上可能偏于内敛、深沉，同时有收藏、研究倾向。\n\n从五行喜忌看，水旺喜火土，火代表光明、装饰、华丽，土代表稳重、传统、收藏。命主身强，喜财官（火土），因此居家风格可能偏向有质感、有历史感或带火土元素的装饰。选项分析：\n\n- A. 炫酷高科技（火金为主，但金水旺，高科技偏金水，可能不喜）\n- B. 欧式高贵典雅，收藏古灵怪摆设（欧式偏金，但古灵怪属土火混杂，有一定吸引力）\n- C. 中式复古，古董和风水物品（中式属土，古董属土，风水物品属土火，非常契合喜用神）\n- D. 环保极简（木水为主，木泄水但水旺木浮，极简偏水，不喜）\n\n综合判断，命主喜土火，中式复古风格最能补益命局，且古董和风水物品符合土性收藏，故选C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4746, "response_id": "6071b7c7-a6fa-4171-8abb-eab74c3a7438", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 336, "total_tokens": 576, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 112}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子，日主壬水生于申月得令，金水两旺，身强喜木火土。丙辰大限（43-52岁，即2016-2025年），丙火为偏财，辰土为七杀，此运财官相生，利于求财创业。\n\n在丙辰大限内，需看流年引动。2015年（乙未）尚在乙卯大限，不在丙辰，排除。2017年（丁酉），丁火正财透出，但酉金为印星，且与命局申酉戌三会金局，金旺生水，财星被泄，不利创业。2018年（戊戌），戊土七杀透干，戌为火库，与命局辰戌冲，冲动事业宫，且戌为燥土，能制水，此年有创业冲动，但辰戌冲主变动，且戌为火库，与饮食（火）相关，但更偏向房地产（土）的变动。2019年（己亥），己土正官，亥水为比肩，亥子丑会水局，身更旺，官星虚浮，且亥为驿马，主远行，但水旺无制，不利求财。\n\n再细看，2018年戊戌，流年天干戊土七杀，地支戌土，与月柱庚申、日柱壬辰形成申酉戌（月支申，流年戌，但缺酉，实际是申戌拱酉）和辰戌冲，辰为水库，戌为火库，冲则水火灾战，且戌为财库，冲开财库，主得财，但辰戌冲也主变动、迁移。此年命主45岁，正值丙辰大限，丙火偏财透出，戌为火库，火主饮食、餐饮，但戌土本身为燥土，也主房地产。然而，辰戌冲，辰为日支（夫妻宫、根基），冲则动，且戌为火库，火为财，财库冲开，主创业得财，但更倾向于不动产（土）的变动，而非饮食（火）的直接体现。\n\n2019年己亥，亥水为驿马，且与命局子水、丑土会水局，水势泛滥，身旺无依，主漂泊，但亥中藏甲木食神，食神生财，但水多木漂，财星不显，且己土官星被水所困，不利事业稳定。因此，2018年更符合“出国创业”的变动，且戌土为火库，但结合辰戌冲，辰为水库，戌为火库，水火既济，但更偏向于“房地产”的土性，因为戌为燥土，主房屋、土地。\n\n综合判断，2018年戊戌，辰戌冲，动土之象，且丙辰大运中，丙火偏财生戌土，土为财库，房地产领域更契合。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 8840, "response_id": "ec545137-8c3a-4d9a-a04d-c8f2f3cc3567", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 687, "total_tokens": 928, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑，月柱庚申，日柱壬辰，时柱壬子。日主壬水生于申月，金水相生，身强。喜用神为火土，忌金水。\n\n2021年为辛丑年。流年天干辛金为正印，地支丑土为正官。但丑土与命局年支丑土伏吟，且与月支申金半合金局（申丑暗合），加重了金的力量，忌神金更旺，印星过重，主压力、阻滞、长辈健康问题。同时，流年丑土与日支辰土相破（辰丑破），夫妻宫或自身根基受损，主事业、财务上的动荡。\n\n大运方面，命主在2021年约48岁，处于癸亥大运（约40-50岁）。大运天干癸水为劫财，地支亥水为比肩，加重水势，水多木漂，财星（火）受克严重。流年辛丑，天干辛金生水，地支丑土虽为官星，但被水势所困，官星无力制水，反而助金生水，导致财星（火）完全被压制。\n\n综合来看，2021年财运极差，印星过旺代表生意上的文书、合同、资金链问题，劫财夺财，官星破财，且丑辰破，主店铺或公司内部结构破裂。疫情后经济环境本就不佳，命主身强忌水，水旺无制，必然导致资金周转不灵，生意难以维持，最终倒闭。选项A最符合此象。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4872, "response_id": "aa974504-3743-45ab-a074-2bb9c2d51e53", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 362, "total_tokens": 603, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子，日主壬水生于申月得令，又得时柱壬子强根，身旺无疑。八字水势泛滥，喜火土来制水调候，但原局火弱土虚（仅丑辰湿土），金水过旺。\n\n2024年为甲辰年，流年天干甲木食神透出，地支辰土与日支辰土伏吟，加重湿土之气。大运方面，命主约在50岁后行甲子运（若按阳男逆排，具体需核实，但此处按常见排法），甲木食神透出，子水为羊刃，水势更旺。流年甲辰与大运甲子，天干双甲木泄水，但地支子辰半合水局，水势更不可挡。\n\n健康上，水过旺则主肾、膀胱、泌尿系统，但更关键的是水多木漂，甲木食神代表身体活动、四肢，被旺水冲激，易有筋骨损伤。同时，原局金旺克木，木主肝胆、筋骨，流年甲木透出受旺金克伐，且辰辰自刑，主身体内部气机不畅，易有意外之伤。时柱壬子为羊刃，羊刃逢冲或合，易有血光之灾。2024年子辰合水，羊刃更旺，且流年辰与日支辰伏吟，伏吟主病痛、反复，结合水旺木漂，最可能应验在骨骼外伤。\n\n选项分析：\nA. 肥胖问题——水旺之人易虚胖，但非主要健康危机。\nB. 脊椎侧弯——久坐导致，但八字无明确土金骨骼受克之象，且非突发。\nC. 鼻癌——金主肺鼻，但原局金旺，流年无火克金，且无强金受克之象，可能性低。\nD. 车祸骨折——水旺木漂，甲木食神为肢体，受旺水冲击，且羊刃逢合，主意外血光，最符合命理特征。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6643, "response_id": "f11ac337-72b0-4b05-9ab8-92f73557291e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 487, "total_tokens": 725, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 110}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，年柱为戊辰，月柱为甲寅，日柱为庚子，时柱为甲申。日主庚金生于寅月，木旺金囚，月干甲木偏财透出，年干戊土偏印生身，但地支寅木与申金相冲（月支与日支、时支），且年支辰土与月支寅木有半会木局之势，木气极旺，克制日主庚金。庚金坐子水伤官，伤官泄身，时支申金为禄根，但被月支寅木冲克，根基不稳。\n\n原生家庭看年柱与月柱。年柱戊辰，戊土偏印为母星，辰土为父星（偏财之库），但月柱甲寅为偏财，偏财代表父亲，甲木坐寅木强根，且得年支辰土滋养，父亲星旺而有力。但月干甲木与年干戊土相克（甲木克戊土），显示父母关系存在冲突。日支子水伤官与月支寅木相生，伤官代表叛逆、不满，可能影响家庭氛围。时柱甲申，申金冲寅木，加剧月柱动荡。\n\n综合来看，父母星（甲木偏财为父，戊土偏印为母）相克明显，且月支寅木被时支申金冲克，家庭根基不稳，有分离之象。年柱戊辰为父母宫，辰土为湿土，可生木，但被月柱甲寅克制，父母关系紧张。日主庚金弱，伤官子水泄气，性格敏感，家庭环境对其影响较大。因月柱为父母宫，甲木偏财（父）坐禄旺，而戊土偏印（母）受克，父亲力量强于母亲，若离异，可能跟随父亲。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5569, "response_id": "3cabe4a9-b776-4d19-9718-0bd4bcc018e9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "completion_tokens": 422, "total_tokens": 645, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 95}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
